  "estimatedMinutes": 2,
  "statement": "In rectangle \\(ABCD,\\) we have \\(A=(6,-22),\\) \\(B=(2006,178),\\) and \\(D=(8,y)\\) for some integer \\(y.\\) What is the area of rectangle \\(ABCD?\\)",
